    <item>
      <title>🔥 [일갤] 이번엔 진짜 전쟁 날 거 같은데..?</title>
      <link>https://gall.dcinside.com/board/view/?id=dcbest&amp;no=472914</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 14:21:02 +0000</pubDate>
